[38.589791, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > In this empty current directory, plan and build a self-contained dependency-free Python project \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mcalled Signal Garden Observatory: generate deterministic synthetic telemetry for several sensors, \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mdetect spikes and drift using robust statistics, produce a polished SVG visualization and a concise \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mterminal dashboard, and include meaningful automated tests. Use only relative paths in the current \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mdirectory, never use the network or external packages; run the program and all tests, fix any \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255missues, and briefly explain what you built and verified. Finish by printing a clear readable final \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mreport with sensor counts, detected anomalies, and the generated artifact path\u2014not a long real-time \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255manimation. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan list_dir(Contents of /tmp/ami-demo-35iKs6: (1 entries)) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KPlan: build a small standard-library-only package with (1) deterministic telemetry generation, (2)\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kmedian/MAD-based spike and rolling-slope drift detection, (3) SVG/dashboard rendering, and (4) unit\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Ktests c